<p>Fictional Northstar Services training material.</p>
<h2>Chronology</h2>
<p>H1 requested September 18; H2 expected September 21, absent September 22 at 10:00.
H3 management pack targeted September 23 at 15:00; actual impact undetermined.
H4 request owner and delivery confirmation by September 22 at 16:00.</p>
<h2>Task</h2>
<p>The controller needs a concise escalation about missing project support that may delay a management pack.</p>
<h2>Actions</h2>
<ol>
<li>Create a chronology from the packet.</li>
<li>Ask AI for an escalation that states risk without asserting the pack will be late.</li>
<li>Check dates and distinguish missing support from blame.</li>
<li>Specify the confirmation request and response time.</li>
<li>Write a neutral alternative opening for use if the support arrives before review.</li>
</ol>
<h2>Output</h2>
<p>Escalation up to 150 words; known/unknown list; subject line; proposed reviewer.</p>
